@baseUrl = http://localhost:5078
# Note: Run sell-household-policy.http or sell-buytolet-policy.http first to set policyReference

### Step 1: Calculate Cancellation Quote
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/policies/{{policyReference}}/cancellation-quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "CancellationDate": "2024-06-15"
}

###

### Step 2: Cancel the Policy
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/policies/{{policyReference}}/cancellation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "CancellationDate": "2024-06-15"
}
